1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,885
You have three floors to learn the rules.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,237
Most people don't make it past one.

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:10,079
It starts with an elevator that only goes down.

4
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,287
OPERATOR: Good morning. This elevator goes down. Please enjoy your stay.

5
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:18,121
There is no up button.

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,838
Floor minus one. Day one.

7
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,377
A sign on the wall: before every action, say thank you.

8
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:34,064
You step out without saying it.

9
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:37,122
The whole floor tilts.

10
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:42,012
You grab a pillar. Thank you, you gasp. And it levels out.

11
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:48,588
Thank you for the step. Thank you for the chair. Thank you for the air.

12
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:54,122
NORA: Thank you for finally showing up.

13
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:58,010
That's Nora. She's been here since yesterday.

14
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:01,895
NORA: Thank you. Don't forget. Not even once.

15
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:06,094
You eat one of your three sandwiches. Thank you.

16
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:11,147
Then a man runs past. He forgets.

17
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:18,259
The floor tips, and he slides right out of sight.

18
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:22,308
At midnight, the elevator dings.

19
00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:25,596
You both say thank you, and step in.

20
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:32,696
OPERATOR: Thank you for choosing Floor Minus. Next stop, minus two.

21
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:39,036
Floor minus two. Day two.

22
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:41,855
Here, the rain falls up.

23
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:46,623
It pools on the ceiling. And the ceiling is getting closer.

24
00:01:48,600 --> 00:01:51,219
NORA: Stay low. The air is at the bottom.

25
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:55,515
You crawl under the desks. Your phone light is all you have.

26
00:01:57,800 --> 00:02:00,012
Under the last desk, you find a note.

27
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,911
It's in your handwriting.

28
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:06,056
Don't trust the Operator.

29
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:10,245
You've never been here before. Have you?

30
00:02:12,600 --> 00:02:15,939
OPERATOR: Please keep your head above water. Thank you.

31
00:02:17,200 --> 00:02:21,089
The water is a hand's width from the floor when the elevator dings.

32
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:27,047
You roll in. Food: one sandwich left.

33
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:32,421
OPERATOR: Next stop, minus three. Please be quiet.

34
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:39,900
Floor minus three. Day three.

35
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:45,139
The Quiet Floor. Every sound above a whisper turns off a light.

36
00:02:47,200 --> 00:02:49,052
Ten lights. Ten mistakes.

37
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:53,322
A creak. Nine.

38
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:56,432
NORA: Walk where I walk.

39
00:02:58,200 --> 00:03:00,138
Your stomach growls. Eight.

40
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:06,159
OPERATOR: Hello! How are you enjoying the Quiet Floor?

41
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:11,959
The Operator is helping. Loudly. Four lights left.

42
00:03:13,600 --> 00:03:15,168
And then, Nora is gone.

43
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:19,887
Ten seconds. You don't dare call her name.

44
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:28,038
Then she's back. Same face. Same smile.

45
00:03:29,600 --> 00:03:31,148
But her scarf is blue.

46
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:34,297
NORA: Thank you for waiting.

47
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:38,140
Nobody says thank you on this floor.

48
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:42,471
The elevator dings. Three lights left.

49
00:03:45,600 --> 00:03:47,748
Day three ends. Food: zero.

50
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:53,371
OPERATOR: Next stop, minus four. Welcome home.

51
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:02,495
Minus four is your apartment.

52
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:06,675
Your sofa. Your plant. Your mug, still warm.

53
00:04:09,600 --> 00:04:11,630
And someone is sitting on your sofa.

54
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,773
It turns around.

55
00:04:17,400 --> 00:04:18,450
It's you.

56
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:23,385
Took you three days. Sit down. Day four is the worst.

57
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:28,490
Day four. Next Saturday.
